== Overview ==
{{Units infobox (this one)|unit_name=Laser Crusher Tank Toilet|image1=LCTT.png}}
The '''Laser Crusher Tank Toilet''' is the final upgrade minion that can be spawned by the [[Engineer Cameraman|Engineer Cameraman]].'''LCTT''' has the most health and dps out of any spawnable unit.'''LCTT''' has 1000000 HP with 10000 DPS.

== Appearance ==
LCTT Is an armored tank toilet. Has a tank like appearance with 2 lasers on the side,2 lays on his toilet tank and 2 jet packs on each side on his back.He wears a military helmet and has a creepy smile.

== Trivia ==

* When someone says '''LCTT''', they are talking about The '''Laser Crusher Tank Toilet'''. It's a shorter way of saying Level 7 upgrade of the [[Engineer Cameraman]].
* It is inspired by the Laser Crusher Tank Toilet In Skibidi Toilet Which Appeared In 76 Part 1
* This Spawnable Unit was added when the engineer got its second to final buff in the '''Episode 76 Part 2 Update'''
* The LCTT has currently the second strongest spawner health among all spawner units with a health of 1 million which beats Chief Clockman’s strongest spawner minion with 500k health. T
* He is based on [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Crusher_Skibidi_Toilet Laser Crusher Skibidi Toilet] in Skibidi Toilet series. 
* [[Zombie Horde Cameraman]] beats this unit with 1.95M health, making this the second strongest. 

